    "updated_at": "2026-10-02T01:28:38Z",
    "body": "`document.implementation.createHTMLDocument` doesn't parse anything so is not a sink.\n\nMissing: `DOMParser`, `document.writeln()`, `javascript:` URLs, XSLT with `<xsl:output method=\"html\">` (if we end up not removing XSLT).\n\nFor fragment parsing, `createContextualFragment()`, `innerHTML`, `outerHTML`, `insertAdjacentHTML()`.\n\nAlso see https://github.com/mozilla/explainers/blob/main/trusted-or-sanitized-html.md",
